OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA band of
OL,6,Frain will move southeastwards across
OL,7,FEngland and Wales overnight, reaching
OL,8,Fsoutheast England later. Elsewhere
OL,9,Fthere will be clear periods, though
OL,10,Fwith some showers in the north and
OL,11,Fnorthwest, where it will also be
OL,12,Fbreezy and rather chilly.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FEarly rain will clear from
OL,15,Fsoutheast England on Friday. Otherwise
OL,16,Fsunny spells are expected, though with
OL,17,Fsome showers feeding in across the UK
OL,18,Fin a cool north to northwesterly wind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
